        "TileImage": "$($repository 7271eae1-6bdd-4936-b763-b2390fb07fe7).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Whittleton Creek, 47.  Recently, high activity in this neigborhood has drawn more attention than we would like.\r\rYou have been cleared to elliminate the suspiciously-perfect Wilsons, the overly-petty Charles Blake III, the security-focused Nolan Cassidy, and the serial killer Helen West.\r\rWe cannot risk our activity in Whittleton Creek being exposed 47. We are already taking a great risk elimating these five, do not pacify, subdue, or kill anyone besides the assigned targets.",
